  "necessity_paragraph": "The patient presents with recurrent episodes of palpitations and lightheadedness, raising concern for paroxysmal atrial fibrillation in the context of a personal history of transient ischemic attacks and cerebral infarction. To evaluate for potential arrhythmic causes of these transient cerebral ischemic events and guide anticoagulation management, a cardiac event monitoring study (CPT 93271) is ordered. This extended monitoring is clinically necessary to identify the arrhythmic etiology associated with diagnosis code G45.9."
